            <image:title>Thermo Fisher Scientific: Lesson 9</image:title>
            <image:caption>Lesson #9: Story Points depend on a shared understanding of the work being estimated. Because hardware teams are often composed of highly specialized experts, effort-based estimates such as Person-Days frequently provide a more practical alternative.</image:caption>
        </image:image>
    </url>
    <url>
        <loc>https://kevinthompsonphd.com/agile-insights-blog/thermo-fisher-scientific-lesson-8</loc>
